    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/ce2dcc0b5fb257fc56cc08670bbaa11a.poster.avif?t=1749133139\" width=720 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/ce2dcc0b5fb257fc56cc08670bbaa11a.webm?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/ce2dcc0b5fb257fc56cc08670bbaa11a.mp4?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Chronal Stasis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a time-warped story as Henry to save his family and bring peace to this world. Equipped with a plasma rifle, and harnessing the power of time combined with modern mechanics; confront adversaries who defy the natural order of history as you know it and uncover the truth behind their unexpected rise to power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/c31d1014c7fba0c3d168efce85d5d205.poster.avif?t=1749133139\" width=720 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/c31d1014c7fba0c3d168efce85d5d205.webm?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/c31d1014c7fba0c3d168efce85d5d205.mp4?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the past, present, and future rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/4f54618d889d39b1e170965a4f5e6422.poster.avif?t=1749133139\" width=720 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/4f54618d889d39b1e170965a4f5e6422.webm?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/4f54618d889d39b1e170965a4f5e6422.mp4?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse centuries of time across multiple levels accompanied by a soundtrack inspired from that era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finely tuned controls and gameplay allow you to quickly and efficiently navigate and fight your way through the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness a myriad of time-bending abilities to defeat your foes! Dash through portals. Rapidly de-age enemies. Freeze the very fabric of time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse array of enemies and vanquish bosses from creepy cultists to ancient Vikings to deranged science experiments!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*\u00a0 This game is still in early development and as a result the images seen are only of 1 level. More diverse game images will come throughout development. *</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/ce2dcc0b5fb257fc56cc08670bbaa11a.poster.avif?t=1749133139\" width=720 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/ce2dcc0b5fb257fc56cc08670bbaa11a.webm?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/ce2dcc0b5fb257fc56cc08670bbaa11a.mp4?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Chronal Stasis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a time-warped story as Henry to save his family and bring peace to this world. Equipped with a plasma rifle, and harnessing the power of time combined with modern mechanics; confront adversaries who defy the natural order of history as you know it and uncover the truth behind their unexpected rise to power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/c31d1014c7fba0c3d168efce85d5d205.poster.avif?t=1749133139\" width=720 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/c31d1014c7fba0c3d168efce85d5d205.webm?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/c31d1014c7fba0c3d168efce85d5d205.mp4?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the past, present, and future rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/4f54618d889d39b1e170965a4f5e6422.poster.avif?t=1749133139\" width=720 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/4f54618d889d39b1e170965a4f5e6422.webm?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927970/extras/4f54618d889d39b1e170965a4f5e6422.mp4?t=1749133139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse centuries of time across multiple levels accompanied by a soundtrack inspired from that era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finely tuned controls and gameplay allow you to quickly and efficiently navigate and fight your way through the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness a myriad of time-bending abilities to defeat your foes! Dash through portals. Rapidly de-age enemies. Freeze the very fabric of time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse array of enemies and vanquish bosses from creepy cultists to ancient Vikings to deranged science experiments!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*\u00a0 This game is still in early development and as a result the images seen are only of 1 level. More diverse game images will come throughout development. *</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Travel to and blast your way through the past, in this 2.5D, time-travel game that combines classic run and gun elements with time-bending abilities. Join Henry as he fights to save his family and fix the timeline. Is it really that simple though?",
